  "details": "I can't look at my own face at all because it's always way too high up... There's no way to rectify this, automatic or manual. even a manual vertical look target offset slider would be great. I just can't use Third Person properly right now because it's not looking in the right place\n\nphoto 1: typical view\n\nphoto 2: photo 1 but zoomed in to show how far off it is\n\nphoto 3: my forehead??? bro wheres my *face* I wanna see that\n\nMy suggested solution is to implement Horizontal Offset and Vertical offset, just like the Camera's \"Look At Me\" feature already has.",
